stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading
  Loading --> Loaded: First read succeeds
  Loading --> Unavailable: Read fails
  Unavailable --> Loading: Try again
  Loaded --> Loaded: Edit draft dates or other filters
  Loaded --> Window: Apply valid dates
  Window --> Window: Apply same day or leap day
  Window --> Invalid: Apply impossible or reversed dates
  Invalid --> Window: Correct and apply dates
  Invalid --> Loaded: Clear and focus search
  Window --> Loaded: Clear and focus search
  Window --> Window: More reasons appends or refresh succeeds
  Window --> LastUpdate: Refresh fails
  LastUpdate --> Window: Explicit retry succeeds
  Loaded --> Retired: Session denied or invalidated
  Window --> Retired: Session denied or invalidated
  LastUpdate --> Retired: Session denied or invalidated
  Retired --> Retired: Late read ignored
  Window --> Disposed: Leave view
  Disposed --> Disposed: Late read or refresh ignored
  %% never Invalid dates replace the last valid applied window.
  %% never Local filter edits start a business request.
  %% never Session retirement or disposal reveals a stale completion.
